"},{"indices":[168,172],"text":"補助金"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"inpit.go.jp/about/topic/20…","expanded_url":"https://www.inpit.go.jp/about/topic/20260817.html","indices":[121,144],"url":"https://t.co/Ew4NuCNPwI"}]},"favorite_count":10,"favorited":false,"full_text":"🧸おもちゃにも知財がある？\n\nINPITは「TOKYOおもちゃショー2026」に出展します！\n\n玩具業界における知財活用の事例や、\n外国出願補助金等の支援メニューをご紹介👀\n\nぜひINPITブース(2-19)へお立ち寄りください！\n\n詳細👇\nhttps://t.co/Ew4NuCNPwI\n\n#TOKYOおもちゃショー2026 #玩具 #補助金","id_str":"2089879139654533298","is_quote_status":true,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":0,"quoted_status_id_str":"2066362562552250574","quoted_status_permalink":{"display":"x.com/tokyo_toyshow/…","expanded":"https://twitter.com/tokyo_toyshow/status/2066362562552250574","url":"https://t.co/LMC5Wl6X6b"},"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":4,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"719342924857626624"},"quoted_status_result":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":53},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2066332207795580928/eFHncPxh_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1747055591753990144/1781486648"},"core":{"created_at":"Tue Jan 16 00:38:32 +0000 2024","name":"TOKYOおもちゃショー","screen_name":"tokyo_toyshow"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjoxNzQ3MDU1NTkxNzUzOTkwMTQ0","is_blue_verified":true,"location":{"location":""},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":false},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"TOKYOおもちゃショー公式アカウントです✨\n8/29(土)・8/30(日)に東京ビッグサイトにて、TOKYOおもちゃショー2026開催🎉\n今年もコロコロ魂フェスティバルと同時開催致します！\n日本おもちゃ大賞2026の情報も発信していきます📣\n#TOKYOおもちゃショー2026\n#日本おもちゃ大賞2026","entities":{"description":{},"url":